# OS files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
# AppleDouble resource forks, created when a macOS host writes to a
# non-HFS/APFS volume. They shadow every file in the tree, so an unqualified
# `git add -A` would otherwise commit hundreds of them.
._*

